      "text": "Algorithms to fetch nearby businesses",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Algorithms to fetch nearby businesses",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Tw_Hdgc4UzarA9eftMAqO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3325.7250367696183,
      "y": 332.76807017425585,
      "width": 1071.7188720703125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 985132108,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 310556276,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784566960578,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Two Dimensional Search -> draw a circle with pre-defined radius and find all the dusinesses within the circle\n\n    Query is not efficient because we need to scan the whole table",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Two Dimensional Search -> draw a circle with pre-defined radius and find all the dusinesses within the circle\n\n    Query is not efficient because we need to scan the whole table",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mCSk2KcfZ9-6lBzeKdRSh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3312.4219634936303,
      "y": 445.4843666156729,
      "width": 1207.93896484375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2076140532,
      "version": 420,
      "versionNonce": 625840628,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784566967487,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Evenly divided grid -> Evenly divide the world into small grids each business on the map belongs to one grid\n    Probelm with this appraoch is that distribution of bussiness is not even\n\n\n3. GeoHash -> works by reducing the 2-D data into ID - geohashing works by recursively dividing the world into smaller and\n    smaller grid with each additional bit.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Evenly divided grid -> Evenly divide the world into small grids each business on the map belongs to one grid\n    Probelm with this appraoch is that distribution of bussiness is not even\n\n\n3. GeoHash -> works by reducing the 2-D data into ID - geohashing works by recursively dividing the world into smaller and\n    smaller grid with each additional bit.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
