    {
      "id": "wFyUM2Csxyg5shNGMTrBU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3874.6569521728866,
      "y": 625.6084710130168,
      "width": 668.0193481445312,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1344037836,
      "version": 402,
      "versionNonce": 63539276,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784566975003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1> Divide the planet into four quadrants along with \n    the prime meridian and equator\n2> Second divide each grid into our smaller girds each grid can\n    be represented by alternating between logitude bit and latitude\n3> Repeat this subdivision until the grid size is within the precision \n    desired. Geohash usually uses base32 representation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1> Divide the planet into four quadrants along with \n    the prime meridian and equator\n2> Second divide each grid into our smaller girds each grid can\n    be represented by alternating between logitude bit and latitude\n3> Repeat this subdivision until the grid size is within the precision \n    desired. Geohash usually uses base32 representation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_M2Y5QOzkn4wFi7A3PH1N",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2165.25226051263,
      "y": 176.0246899898816,
      "width": 2384.2776297230707,
