      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784566975003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Edge Cases : two location can be very close but have no shared prefix\n    at all if they are located in two different grid lang/long apart\n    because of this simple prefix sql query would fail\n\n2. Edge Cases : Two position can have a long shared prefix but they belong\n    to different geohashes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Edge Cases : two location can be very close but have no shared prefix\n    at all if they are located in two different grid lang/long apart\n    because of this simple prefix sql query would fail\n\n2. Edge Cases : Two position can have a long shared prefix but they belong\n    to different geohashes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yfNioGUVki_Zdz5-juoAn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3797.087013474625,
      "y": 1124.0982601440996,
      "width": 728.29931640625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1513999308,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 1552745036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784566975003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Common solution is to fetch all businesses not only within the current grid\nbut also from its neighbors geohashes of neighbors can be calculated in\nconstant time",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Common solution is to fetch all businesses not only within the current grid\nbut also from its neighbors geohashes of neighbors can be calculated in\nconstant time",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dMRC-pmOqprwMUTUTK8RN",
      "type": "line",
      "x": 3288.9934932434885,
      "y": 1241.6609572190712,
      "width": 1262.461653891282,
      "height": 0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
